msgstr "سمة ألوان HUD: الافتراضية (برتقالي FICSIT)، أو الداكنة، أو الكلاسيكية، أو عالية التباين، أو المبسطة، أو أحادية اللون."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(62)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.HypertubeRoutingMode"
msgid "Hypertube Routing Mode"
msgstr "وضع توجيه أنابيب النقل الفائقة"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(63)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.HypertubeRoutingMode.TT"
msgid "How auto-connected hypertubes are shaped: Auto, 2D, Straight, Curve, Noodle, or Horizontal-to-Vertical."
msgstr "كيفية تشكيل أنابيب النقل الفائقة الموصّلة تلقائياً: تلقائي، ثنائي الأبعاد، مستقيم، منحنى، نودل، أو أفقي إلى عمودي."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(36)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.LiftUsageMode"
msgid "Factory Connection"
msgstr "اتصال المصنع"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(37)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.LiftUsageMode.TT"
msgid "Belts Only keeps ordinary belt routing. Lift at Distributor keeps the belt at machine height; Lift at Building keeps it at distributor height. Native costs and placement restrictions apply."
msgstr "يحتفظ خيار 'السيور فقط' بتوجيه السيور العادي. يبقي خيار 'رافعة السير عند الموزع' السير على ارتفاع الآلة؛ ويبقي خيار 'رافعة السير عند المبنى' على ارتفاع الموزع. تنطبق التكاليف الأصلية وقيود الوضع."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(93)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.NearbyLogisticsRange"
msgid "Nearby Logistics Range (m)"
msgstr "نطاق الخدمات اللوجستية القريبة (م)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(94)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.NearbyLogisticsRange.TT"
msgid "Maximum connector-to-connector distance for nearby factory belt and pipe Auto-Connect. Blueprint seams and manifold lanes are unaffected."
msgstr "أقصى مسافة من موصل إلى موصل للتوصيل التلقائي لأحزمة وأنابيب المصانع القريبة. لا تتأثر وصلات المخططات ومسارات المجمّع."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(53)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeIndicator"
msgid "Flow Indicator"
msgstr "مؤشر التدفق"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(54)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeIndicator.TT"
msgid "Show a flow-direction indicator on auto-connected pipes."
msgstr "إظهار مؤشر اتجاه التدفق على الأنابيب المتصلة تلقائياً."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(47)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeLevelMain"
msgid "Main Tier"
msgstr "المستوى الرئيسي"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(48)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeLevelMain.TT"
msgid "Pipe tier for the main connections. Auto uses the highest tier you've unlocked."
msgstr "مستوى الأنبوب للوصلات الرئيسية. يستخدم \"تلقائي\" أعلى مستوى فتحته."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(49)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeLevelToBuilding"
msgid "To Building"
msgstr "إلى المبنى"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(50)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeLevelToBuilding.TT"
msgid "Pipe tier for connections to buildings. Auto uses the highest tier you've unlocked."
msgstr "مستوى الأنبوب لوصلات المباني. يستخدم \"تلقائي\" أعلى مستوى فتحته."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(51)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeRoutingMode"
msgid "Pipe Routing Mode"
msgstr "وضع توجيه الأنبوب"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(52)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PipeRoutingMode.TT"
msgid "How auto-connected pipes are shaped: Auto, 2D, Straight, Curve, Noodle, or Horizontal-to-Vertical."
msgstr "كيفية تشكيل الأنابيب المتصلة تلقائياً: تلقائي، ثنائي الأبعاد، مستقيم، منحنى، نودل، أو أفقي إلى عمودي."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(73)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectMode"
msgid "Grid Axis"
msgstr "محور الشبكة"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(74)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectMode.TT"
msgid "Which directions power poles connect: Auto, X only, Y only, or both X and Y."
msgstr "الاتجاهات التي تتصل بها أعمدة الطاقة: تلقائي، X فقط، Y فقط، أو X وY معاً."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(75)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectRange"
msgid "Connection Range"
msgstr "نطاق التوصيل"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(76)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectRange.TT"
msgid "Maximum distance, in meters, to search for a power connection."
msgstr "أقصى مسافة، بالأمتار، للبحث عن وصلة طاقة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(77)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectReserved"
msgid "Connections to Keep Free"
msgstr "التوصيلات المحجوزة"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(78)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.PowerConnectReserved.TT"
msgid "Number of pole connection slots to leave free for your own manual wiring."
msgstr "عدد فتحات توصيل العمود التي تُترك حرّة لتوصيلك اليدوي."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(133)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.RotationIncrement"
msgid "Rotation Increment (deg)"
msgstr "مقدار زيادة الدوران (درجة)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(134)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.RotationIncrement.TT"
msgid "Degrees of rotation added per scroll notch (also walk segment turn)."
msgstr "درجات الدوران المضافة لكل نقرة تمرير (وأيضاً زاوية انعطاف مقطع المشي)."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(127)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.SpacingIncrement"
msgid "Spacing Increment (m)"
msgstr "مقدار زيادة التباعد (م)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(128)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.SpacingIncrement.TT"
msgid "Meters of spacing added per scroll notch (also Extend spacing and walk segment advance)."
msgstr "أمتار التباعد المضافة لكل نقرة تمرير (وأيضاً تباعد التمديد وتقدّم مقطع المشي)."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(131)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.StaggerIncrement"
msgid "Stagger Increment (m)"
msgstr "مقدار زيادة التداخل (م)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(132)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.StaggerIncrement.TT"
msgid "Meters of stagger added per scroll notch (also walk segment shift)."
msgstr "أمتار التداخل المضافة لكل نقرة تمرير (وأيضاً إزاحة مقطع المشي)."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(129)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.StepsIncrement"
msgid "Steps Increment (m)"
msgstr "مقدار زيادة الخطوات (م)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(130)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.StepsIncrement.TT"
msgid "Meters of stepping added per scroll notch (also walk segment rise)."
msgstr "أمتار الخطوات المضافة لكل نقرة تمرير (وأيضاً ارتفاع مقطع المشي)."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(119)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bApplyImmediately"
msgid "Apply Immediately"
msgstr "تطبيق فوري"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(120)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bApplyImmediately.TT"
msgid "Apply Smart Panel changes instantly instead of clicking the Apply button."
msgstr "تطبيق تغييرات لوحة Smart فوراً بدلاً من النقر على زر التطبيق."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(28)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoConnectDistributors"
msgid "Use Manifold Lane Belts"
msgstr "استخدام أحزمة مسار المجمّع"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(29)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoConnectDistributors.TT"
msgid "Chain distributors together with manifold lane belts, so a whole row is fed from one input."
msgstr "ربط الموزّعات معاً بأحزمة مسار المجمّع، بحيث يٌغذّى صف كامل من مدخل واحد."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(26)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoConnectEnabled"
msgid "Belt Auto-Connect"
msgstr "توصيل أحزمة تلقائي"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(27)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoConnectEnabled.TT"
msgid "Automatically connect conveyor belts between placed buildings and distributors."
msgstr "توصيل السيور الناقلة تلقائياً بين المباني الموضوعة والموزّعات."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(117)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoHoldOnGridChange"
msgid "Auto-Hold on Grid Change"
msgstr "تثبيت تلقائي عند تغيير الشبكة"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(118)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bAutoHoldOnGridChange.TT"
msgid "Automatically lock the hologram in place after any grid change. Press the Hold key to release it."
msgstr "تثبيت الهولوغرام في مكانه تلقائياً بعد أي تغيير في الشبكة. اضغط مفتاح التثبيت لتحريره."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(85)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bBlueprintSeamAutoConnectEnabled"
msgid "Blueprint Seam Auto-Connect"
msgstr "التوصيل التلقائي لوصلات المخطط"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(86)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bBlueprintSeamAutoConnectEnabled.TT"
msgid "Connect compatible open belt, pipe, Hypertube, railway and vehicle-path tails between repeated Blueprints. Lift tails can align vertical belt connections. Native direction, length, slope, placement rules and normal material costs apply; unmarked building ports are not connection intent."
msgstr "اربط ذيول السيور، الأنابيب، أنابيب النقل الفائق، السكك الحديدية، ومسارات المركبات المفتوحة والمتوافقة بين المخططات المتكررة. يمكن لذيول رافعات السير محاذاة اتصالات السيور العمودية. تنطبق الاتجاهات الأصلية، الأطوال، الانحدارات، قواعد الوضع، وتكاليف المواد العادية؛ منافذ المباني غير المحددة لا تعني نية الاتصال."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(115)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendDaisyChainPoleless"
msgid "Daisy-Chain Pole-less Factories"
msgstr "ربط المصانع بلا أعمدة تسلسلياً"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(116)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendDaisyChainPoleless.TT"
msgid "When you Extend a factory that has no power pole and no existing daisy link (starting a fresh manifold), wire the new buildings together with daisy-chain power. Factories already daisy-chained are always continued regardless of this option."
msgstr "عند تمديد مصنع بلا عمود طاقة وبلا رابط تسلسلي موجود (بدء مجمّع جديد)، اربط المباني الجديدة معاً بطاقة تسلسلية. المصانع المربوطة تسلسلياً مسبقاً تُكمَل دائماً بغضّ النظر عن هذا الخيار."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(113)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendDaisyChainPower"
msgid "Extend Daisy-Chain Power"
msgstr "تمديد الطاقة التسلسلية"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(114)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendDaisyChainPower.TT"
msgid "Once Upgraded Power Connectors is unlocked, Extend wires power directly building-to-building along the lane instead of running a pole to each building."
msgstr "بمجرد فتح موصلات الطاقة المحسنة، يربط التمديد الطاقة مباشرة من مبنى إلى مبنى على طول المسار بدلاً من تمرير عمود إلى كل مبنى."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(109)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendEnabled"
msgid "Extend Enabled"
msgstr "تمكين التمديد"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(110)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendEnabled.TT"
msgid "Enable Extend - repeat a building or grid outward in one direction."
msgstr "تفعيل التمديد - تكرار مبنى أو شبكة للخارج في اتجاه واحد."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(111)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendPowerEnabled"
msgid "Extend Power Poles"
msgstr "تمديد أعمدة الكهرباء"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(112)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bExtendPowerEnabled.TT"
msgid "Include power poles when using Extend."
msgstr "تضمين أعمدة الطاقة عند استخدام التمديد."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(60)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bHypertubeAutoConnectEnabled"
msgid "Hypertube Auto-Connect"
msgstr "توصيل أنبوب النقل الفائق تلقائياً"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(61)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bHypertubeAutoConnectEnabled.TT"
msgid "Automatically connect hypertubes between placed supports."
msgstr "توصيل أنابيب النقل الفائقة تلقائياً بين الدعامات الموضوعة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(45)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPipeAutoConnectEnabled"
msgid "Pipe Auto-Connect"
msgstr "توصيل خط الأنابيب تلقائياً"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(46)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPipeAutoConnectEnabled.TT"
msgid "Automatically connect pipes between placed buildings."
msgstr "توصيل الأنابيب تلقائياً بين المباني الموضوعة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(122)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPlayerRelativeControls"
msgid "Player Relative Controls"
msgstr "تحكم نسبي للاعب"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(123)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPlayerRelativeControls.TT"
msgid "Interpret building controls relative to the direction you are facing. The Smart Panel continues to show absolute axes."
msgstr "تفسير عناصر التحكم في البناء نسبةً إلى الاتجاه الذي تنظر إليه. تستمر لوحة Smart في عرض المحاور المطلقة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(69)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPowerAutoConnectEnabled"
msgid "Power Auto-Connect"
msgstr "توصيل الطاقة تلقائياً"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(70)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPowerAutoConnectEnabled.TT"
msgid "Automatically wire power between placed buildings and nearby power poles."
msgstr "توصيل الطاقة تلقائياً بين المباني الموضوعة وأعمدة الطاقة القريبة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(107)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPreserveUpgradeDismantleGroups"
msgid "Preserve Upgrade Dismantle Groups"
msgstr "الحفاظ على مجموعات التفكيك للترقيات"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(108)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bPreserveUpgradeDismantleGroups.TT"
msgid "Default for preserving existing dismantle-group membership during Smart upgrades and supported downgrades. Can be overridden in the Upgrade panel."
msgstr "الافتراضي للحفاظ على عضوية مجموعات التفكيك الحالية أثناء ترقيات Smart وعمليات التخفيض المدعومة. يمكن التجاوز في لوحة الترقية."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(71)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bScaleDaisyChainPower"
msgid "Scale Daisy-Chain Power"
msgstr "تسلسل الطاقة عند التحجيم"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(72)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bScaleDaisyChainPower.TT"
msgid "When Upgraded Power Connectors is unlocked, scaling factories and generators wires adjacent buildings together along the grid X axis."
msgstr "عند فتح موصلات الطاقة المحسنة، يؤدي تحجيم المصانع والمولّدات إلى ربط المباني المتجاورة معاً على طول محور X للشبكة."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(165)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrowLabels"
msgid "Arrow Axis Labels"
msgstr "تسميات محاور الأسهم"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(166)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrowLabels.TT"
msgid "Show X/Y/Z axis labels on the direction arrows."
msgstr "إظهار تسميات محاور X/Y/Z على أسهم الاتجاه."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(163)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrowOrbit"
msgid "Arrow Orbit Animation"
msgstr "حركة دوران الأسهم"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(164)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrowOrbit.TT"
msgid "Animate the arrows orbiting the hologram. Turn off for static arrows that still track you."
msgstr "تحريك الأسهم دائرة حول الهولوغرام. أوقفه للحصول على أسهم ثابتة تتتبّعك."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(161)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrows"
msgid "Show Direction Arrows"
msgstr "إظهار أسهم الاتجاه"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(162)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowArrows.TT"
msgid "Show X/Y/Z direction arrows on the building hologram."
msgstr "إظهار أسهم اتجاه X/Y/Z على هولوغرام المبنى."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(146)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowHUD"
msgid "Show HUD Overlay"
msgstr "إظهار HUD"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(147)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bShowHUD.TT"
msgid "Show the Smart! overlay (grid, scale, and recipe info) while building."
msgstr "إظهار واجهة Smart! (معلومات الشبكة والمقياس والوصفة) أثناء البناء."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(38)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bStackableBeltEnabled"
msgid "Stackable Belt Auto-Connect"
msgstr "توصيل أحزمة قابلة للتكديس"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(39)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bStackableBeltEnabled.TT"
msgid "Allow auto-connected belts to stack vertically where they overlap."
msgstr "السماح للأحزمة المتصلة تلقائياً بالتكديس عمودياً حيث تتداخل."

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(124)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bToggleTransformModes"
msgid "Tap to Toggle Transform Modes"
msgstr "تبديل أوضاع التحويل بضغطة"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(125)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.bToggleTransformModes.TT"
msgid "Tap a transform key (Spacing, Steps, Stagger, Rotation, or Recipe on a factory) to switch the mode on; tap it again to switch it off. Made for controllers and Steam Input radial menus, which cannot hold a key. Off keeps the normal hold-to-use behavior."
msgstr "اضغط ضغطة واحدة على مفتاح تحويل (التباعد، الخطوات، الإزاحة، الدوران، أو الوصفة على مصنع) لتشغيل الوضع؛ واضغط عليه مرة أخرى لإيقافه. مصمّم لوحدات التحكم وقوائم Steam Input الدائرية التي لا يمكنها الاستمرار في الضغط على مفتاح. الإيقاف يبقي سلوك الضغط المستمر المعتاد."

